This software and its accompanying documentation (the "Software") are the
confidential and proprietary property of Roland Wouapit and Bouquet
Innovation (the "Owner").

1. GRANT
   No licence is granted except by a separate written agreement signed by
   the Owner. Access to this repository does not confer any right to use,
   copy, modify, merge, publish, distribute, sublicense or sell the
   Software.

2. RESTRICTIONS
   Without the Owner's prior written consent you may not:
   (a) reproduce or distribute the Software in whole or in part;
   (b) create derivative works;
   (c) reverse engineer, decompile or disassemble any part of it;
   (d) remove or alter any proprietary notice;
   (e) use the Software to provide services to third parties.

3. CONFIDENTIALITY
   The Software contains trade secrets, including insurance rating tables,
   underwriting logic and fraud-detection rules. Recipients must protect it
   with at least the care they apply to their own confidential information,
   and in no event with less than reasonable care.

4. DATA PROTECTION
   The Software processes personal data of advocates registered with the
   Cameroon Bar Association, including national identity numbers, and
   processes payment transactions. Any authorised use must comply with
   Cameroonian Law No. 2010/012 of 21 December 2010 on cybersecurity and
   cybercriminality, the CIMA Insurance Code, and applicable data-protection
   law.

5. NO WARRANTY
   THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS
   OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO THE WARRANTIES OF
   MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE AND NONINFRINGEMENT.

6. LIMITATION OF LIABILITY
   IN NO EVENT SHALL THE OWNER BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES OR OTHER
   LIABILITY, WHETHER IN AN ACTION OF CONTRACT, TORT OR OTHERWISE, ARISING
   FROM, OUT OF OR IN CONNECTION WITH THE SOFTWARE OR ITS USE.

7. GOVERNING LAW
   This licence is governed by the laws of the Republic of Cameroon. Any
   dispute falls to the competent courts of Douala.

